{"id":"b5","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Sheet grid"},
{"id":"b6","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"type:\"sheet\"","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" docs open as the grid editor ("},{"type":"text","value":"editor_view: :sheet","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"text","value":"SheetGrid","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" LiveComponent), not the field form. Edits are session ops ("},{"type":"text","value":"Sheets.Session.apply_ops/3","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"); the component never applies ops locally — StudioLive forwards "},{"type":"text","value":"{:sheets_op, …}","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" deltas via "},{"type":"text","value":"send_update/3","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", so own + remote edits ride ONE path. Presence cursors/selections paint on an overlay layer SIBLING to the table (perf: never in the cell comprehension). Cmd/Ctrl+Z / +Shift+Z send per-user undo/redo ops. Render bound: used range, hard cap 500 rows."}]},
